#: ../../source/recipes.rst:2
msgid "Практические рецепты"
msgstr "Practical recipes"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:5
msgid "Последовательное появление сегментов"
msgstr "Sequential segment reveal"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:7
msgid "Используйте:"
msgstr "Use:"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:9
msgid ""
"GROW            0% → 100%\n"
"SPEED_MOD       TIME\n"
"OVERLAP         0%\n"
"SORT_MODE       BASE"
msgstr ""
"GROW            0% → 100%\n"
"SPEED_MOD       TIME\n"
"OVERLAP         0%\n"
"SORT_MODE       BASE"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:16
msgid "Сегменты будут появляться в исходном порядке и без перекрытия."
msgstr "Segments will appear in their original order with no overlap."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:19
msgid "Появление по длине"
msgstr "Reveal by length"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:21
msgid "Установите ``SPEED_MOD = LENGTH``. Длинные группы получат больше времени, а визуальная скорость движения границы станет равномернее."
msgstr "Set ``SPEED_MOD = LENGTH``. Longer groups receive more time, making the visible boundary move at a more uniform speed."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:25
msgid "Плавная передача между сегментами"
msgstr "Smooth transitions between segments"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:27
msgid "Увеличьте ``OVERLAP``. Начните с ``10–20%`` и подбирайте значение по количеству групп и желаемому ритму."
msgstr "Increase ``OVERLAP``. Start with ``10–20%`` and adjust it for the number of groups and the desired rhythm."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:31
msgid "Рост от центра наружу"
msgstr "Growth from the center outward"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:33
msgid ""
"SYMMETRY        ON\n"
"ANCHOR_MODE     CENTER\n"
"PROPORTIONAL    ON\n"
"SPLINE_TYPE     OPEN PROPORTIONAL"
msgstr ""
"SYMMETRY        ON\n"
"ANCHOR_MODE     CENTER\n"
"PROPORTIONAL    ON\n"
"SPLINE_TYPE     OPEN PROPORTIONAL"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:40
msgid "Для радиального набора попробуйте ``ANCHOR_MODE = CIRCLE``."
msgstr "For a radial arrangement, try ``ANCHOR_MODE = CIRCLE``."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:43
msgid "Зеркальная последовательность"
msgstr "Mirrored sequence"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:45
msgid ""
"SORT_MODE       MIRROR\n"
"MIRROR_DIR      ON или OFF\n"
"ANCHOR_SORT_MODE MIRROR"
msgstr ""
"SORT_MODE       MIRROR\n"
"MIRROR_DIR      ON or OFF\n"
"ANCHOR_SORT_MODE MIRROR"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:51
msgid "``ID_OFFSET`` позволяет повернуть начальную точку последовательности."
msgstr "``ID_OFFSET`` lets you rotate the starting point of the sequence."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:54
msgid "Бегущая видимая полоса"
msgstr "Moving visible strip"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:56
msgid "Анимируйте Grow и Trim с одинаковым интервалом:"
msgstr "Animate Grow and Trim with the same interval:"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:58
msgid ""
"Кадр 0:    TRIM 0%,  GROW 20%\n"
"Кадр 100:  TRIM 80%, GROW 100%"
msgstr ""
"Frame 0:    TRIM 0%,  GROW 20%\n"
"Frame 100:  TRIM 80%, GROW 100%"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:63
msgid "Для циклического движения попробуйте подходящий ``TRIM_BOUNCE_MODE``."
msgstr "For cyclic movement, try an appropriate ``TRIM_BOUNCE_MODE``."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:66
msgid "Скручивание при появлении"
msgstr "Twisting during the reveal"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:68
msgid ""
"ROTATION_START       0°\n"
"ROTATION_END         720°\n"
"ROTATION_DEFORM_MODE GLOBAL"
msgstr ""
"ROTATION_START       0°\n"
"ROTATION_END         720°\n"
"ROTATION_DEFORM_MODE GLOBAL"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:74
msgid "Дополнительно задайте Function Curve для ускорения вращения к концу."
msgstr "Optionally, use a Function Curve to accelerate the rotation toward the end."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:77
msgid "Объединение близких сегментов"
msgstr "Merging nearby segments"

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:79
msgid "Включите ``MERGE PAIR``."
msgstr "Enable ``MERGE PAIR``."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:80
msgid "Выберите ``SEARCH METHOD = REAL``."
msgstr "Select ``SEARCH METHOD = REAL``."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:81
msgid "Установите небольшой ``SEARCH RADIUS REAL``."
msgstr "Set a small ``SEARCH RADIUS REAL``."

#: ../../source/recipes.rst:82
msgid "Ограничьте ``MAX NEIG``, чтобы не получить одну большую группу."
msgstr "Limit ``MAX NEIG`` to avoid producing a single large group."
